P18-V01 direct subscription-group configuration lookup on 2026-10-21:
- Added MQClientApi::get_subscription_group_config and its nullable-input
  adapter for pinned Java MQClientAPIImpl.getSubscriptionGroupConfig, request
  352. The typed request header carries nullable group plus inherited
  namespace, broker-name, and oneway fields.
- The synchronous RPC uses configured VIP conversion, returns an optional
  SubscriptionGroupConfig (a missing Java body is null), and preserves Broker
  response errors. Invoked Java fixtures and Rust differential cases cover
  populated/default bodies, null/empty groups, missing body, and rejection.
  A VIP-enabled loopback verifies the address transform.
